	    quid       	"37BC91A60281"
	    documentation 	
|This Class encapsulates 3 dimensional Mapping to 2 Dimensions. 
| * This Implementation is targeted for simple Vectors, 
| * but it uses the Methods from Tensor. 
| 
	    
