		(object Operation "Coordinates3D"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670145"
		    documentation 	
|Constructor that takes the StandPoint, the ViewPoint and the Ranges. 
|	 * Projective Geometry is switched off, since the Scaling Factor is given 
|	 * by the Ratio of the Target RectAngle Diagonal 
|	 * and the maximum Extent of Objects within the Box given by the Line.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "StandPoint"
			    type       	"BodyTensor")
			(object Parameter "Target"
			    type       	"Rectangle")
			(object Parameter "Origin"
			    type       	"Vector.Line")
			(object Parameter "ViewPoint"
			    type       	"BodyTensor"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "Coordinates3D"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3867014A"
		    documentation 	
|Constructor that takes the current StandPoint, the Direction and the Ranges. 
|	 * Projective Geometry is switched on, since no original Length is specified.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "StandPoint"
			    type       	"BodyTensor")
			(object Parameter "ViewDirection"
			    type       	"BodyTensor")
			(object Parameter "Origin"
			    type       	"Vector.Line")
			(object Parameter "Target"
			    type       	"Rectangle"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "Coordinates3D"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3867014F"
		    documentation 	
|Constructor that takes the StandPoint, the ViewPoint and the Ranges. 
|	 * Projective Geometry is switched on, since no original Length is specified. 
|	 * Scaling fits the Diagonal of the Target RectAngle to the Distance to the ViewPoint.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "StandPoint"
			    type       	"BodyTensor")
			(object Parameter "Target"
			    type       	"Rectangle")
			(object Parameter "ViewPoint"
			    type       	"BodyTensor"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "Coordinates3D"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670153"
		    documentation 	
|Constructor that takes the current StandPoint, the Direction and the Ranges. 
|	 * Projective Geometry is switched on, since no original Length is specified.
|	 * Scaling fits the Diagonal of the Target RectAngle to the Distance to the ViewPoint.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "StandPoint"
			    type       	"BodyTensor")
			(object Parameter "ViewDirection"
			    type       	"BodyTensor")
			(object Parameter "Target"
			    type       	"Rectangle"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670157"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Coordinates to the Target Range.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "x"
			    type       	"double")
			(object Parameter "y"
			    type       	"double")
			(object Parameter "z"
			    type       	"double"))
		    result     	"Point2D"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3867015B"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Coordinates to the Target Range.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "v"
			    type       	"double[]"))
		    result     	"Point2D"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3867015D"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Arrow (Start, Start+delta) 
|	 * to the 2-dimensional Points (StartPt, map())	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "Start"
			    type       	"Tensor")
			(object Parameter "delta"
			    type       	"Tensor")
			(object Parameter "StartPt"
			    type       	"Point2D"))
		    result     	"Point2D"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670161"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Coordinates of the transformed Vector to the Target Range.
|	 * All other mapping Methods are delegated to this one!
|	 * The z Coordinate is mapped into Integer Range also!	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "V"
			    type       	"Tensor"))
		    result     	"Point2D"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670163"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Coordinates to the Target Range, 
|	 * the alternative to map the coordinates independently, is no longer valid.
|	 * There is little optimization possible by integrating the Coordinates 
|	 * into a single Tensor.
|	 * The Sequence is determined by the z-Distances to the ViewPoint.
|	 * You could as well use the overall Distance, 
|	 * but the z-Distance is calculated anyway (on projective Mapping)	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "V"
			    type       	"Tensor[]"))
		    result     	"Point2D[]"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670165"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Coordinates to the Target Range, 
|	 * the alternative to map the coordinates independently, is no longer valid.
|	 * There is little optimization possible by integrating the Coordinates 
|	 * into a single Tensor. 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "x"
			    type       	"double[]")
			(object Parameter "y"
			    type       	"double[]")
			(object Parameter "z"
			    type       	"double[]"))
		    result     	"Point2D[]"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "Map"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38670169"
		    documentation 	
|Maps the Coordinates of the transformed Vectors to the Target Range.
|	 * The Rows of this Matrix are mapped in one call.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "V"
			    type       	"Tensor"))
		    result     	"Point2D[]"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "RMitten"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
			(object Attribute
			    tool       	"Java"
			    name       	"Static"
			    value      	TRUE))
		    quid       	"37BD3867016B"
		    documentation 	
|Calculates the Index of the Standpoint within this Raster	
|	 * Using a linear Search here instead of Bisection. 
|	 * If the Order is reversed, the Return Value is negative. 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "x"
			    type       	"Manifold")
			(object Parameter "SP"
			    type       	"MetricIRing"))
		    result     	"int"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "PlotRecursion"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
			(object Attribute
			    tool       	"Java"
			    name       	"Static"
			    value      	TRUE))
		    quid       	"37BD3867016E"
		    documentation 	
|Helper Method to paint rastered Data with a Sequence in Direction to the ViewPoint	
|	 * The Algorithm is the same as in 'Tensor.Tensor(intFunction)'  
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "Figure"
			    type       	"intDraw")
			(object Parameter "V"
			    type       	"Tensor")
			(object Parameter "R"
			    type       	"Manifold[]")
			(object Parameter "S"
			    type       	"Tensor")
			(object Parameter "Start"
			    type       	"boolean[]")
			(object Parameter "ab"
			    type       	"boolean[]")
			(object Parameter "Middle"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "Index"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "dim"
			    type       	"int"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Protected"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "PlotOrdered"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
			(object Attribute
			    tool       	"Java"
			    name       	"Static"
			    value      	TRUE))
		    quid       	"37BD38670178"
		    documentation 	
|Paints a Raster of Points on the Raster contained in the Vectors of R; 
|	 * 
|	 * The Difference to the Plot Routine is 
|	 * paints in the Direction to the ViewPoint, 
|	 * so the nearer Points hide the ones far out.
|	 * 
|	 * Only the Preprocessing is done here, the real Plotting is done in 'PlotRecursion'
|	 * The Algorithm is the same as in 'Tensor.Tensor(intFunction)'  
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "ViewPoint"
			    type       	"Tensor")
			(object Parameter "Figure"
			    type       	"intDraw")
			(object Parameter "R"
			    type       	"Manifold[]")
			(object Parameter "S"
			    type       	"Tensor"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "PlotOrdered"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3867017D"
		    documentation 	
|Paints a Raster of Point on the Raster contained in the Vectors of R; 
|	 * 
|	 * The Difference to the Plot Routine is 
|	 * that it paints in the Direction to the ViewPoint, 
|	 * so the nearer Points hide the ones far out.
|	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "Figure"
			    type       	"intDraw")
			(object Parameter "R"
			    type       	"Manifold[]")
			(object Parameter "S"
			    type       	"Tensor"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
